#: themes/default/views/manage/Pawtucket/edit_analytics_integration_html.php:35
msgid "Web analytics integration"
msgstr "Integración de analítica web"

#: themes/default/views/manage/Pawtucket/edit_analytics_integration_html.php:38
msgid ""
"Web analytics services track and report on application usage and user "
"behavior patterns. Typically, inclusion of service-specific analytics "
"integration code is required. This code should have been provided by your "
"analytics provider and is specific to your account.  Enter it below and it "
"will be embedded on all Pawtucket-served pages."
msgstr ""
"Los servicios de analítica web siguen a y reportan sobre los usos y los "
"modos de comportamientos de usuarios. Se suele necesitar incluir código de "
"integración de analítica específica al servicio. Este código debería ser "
"ofrecido por su proveedor de analítica, y es específico a su cuenta. "
"Incorpórelo aquí abajo y será embebido en todas las páginas servidas por "
"Pawtucket."

#: themes/default/views/manage/Pawtucket/edit_global_values_html.php:35
msgid "Global value editor"
msgstr "Editor de valores globales"

#: themes/default/views/manage/Pawtucket/edit_global_values_html.php:38
msgid ""
"Global values are editable text values that may be displayed in any view "
"template in your Pawtucket theme. They are especially useful for managing "
"semi-static text embedded in a web site, such as upcoming holiday hours or "
"planned maintenance. You may edit globals using the form below. Configure "
"additional global values by adding them to your theme app.conf configuration "
"file."
